---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="A little more about Andrew Dobrow, his work, and his projects." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <header class="page-heading">
        <div class="eyebrow">More about me</div>
        <h1>About</h1>
        <p>A little background on me.</p>
      </header>
      <article class="prose">
        <p>I'm Andrew Dobrow, a dad, writer, publisher, and builder based on Florida's Treasure Coast.</p>
        <p>I've been writing on the internet for most of my adult life. I was the managing editor of Gearfuse for 8 years (it's sadly been transformed into an SEO content farm, but was once one of the coolest blogs on the web), and wrote for some of the largest gadget and geek culture blogs of the early-2010s, including Coolest Gadgets, <a href="https://www.ubergizmo.com/">Ubergizmo</a>, and more. This site is my way of having a little place that I can shape myself, without algorithms deciding what matters.</p>
        <p>My work has taken me through sales, operations, notary services, and building digital products. These days I'm especially invested in <a href="https://treasurecoast.today/">Treasure Coast Today</a>, the independent local news site I launched in June 2026.</p>
        <p>I don't promise to write on a schedule, though I aim to post several times per week. I do hope to keep using this space to document the work, the setbacks, the small victories, and whatever else feels worth putting into words.</p>
        <h2>Things I've built or worked on</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://treasurecoast.today/">Treasure Coast Today</a> — local news for Florida's Treasure Coast</li>
          <li><a href="https://treasurecoastnotaryservice.com/">Treasure Coast Notary Service</a> — a mobile notary business serving Martin County.</li>
          <li><a href="https://comingattractions.app/">Coming Attractions</a> — a silly little movie and TV discovery tool. The cure for streaming decision paralysis.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Find me elsewhere</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewdobrow/">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://mastodon.social/@lumpmotif" rel="me">Mastodon</a></li>
	  <li><a href="https://bsky.app/profile/andrewdobrow.bsky.social" rel="me">Bluesky</a></li>
</ul>

